win-back-pipeline.tsx / win-back-cadence-preview.tsx: rounded-2xl ->
rounded-lg, rounded-xl -> rounded-md (Current Week Feed's left/right
cards, the toolbar, Recovery Cadence), plus dropped a leftover
bg-zinc-100/80 header-strip fill.

Also found and fixed the same bug just fixed in pile-on-pipeline.tsx:
`selected` fell back to filtered.find(id === selectedId) across the
WHOLE engagement's items (loaded once, no per-month refetch here
either) instead of just the selected day's — same "stale selection
persists across a month switch" bug, same fix.

